.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt GETTY 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm getty
.Nd console login prompt and session launcher
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the one-shot console login service.
It opens
.Pa tty:console
through
.Xr consd 8 ,
prints the banner and
.Dq Li "login: " ,
reads the login name and starts
.Xr login 1
with that name.
.Nm
waits for
.Xr login 1
and starts the session shell only when it exits 0.
The shell path is the root shell from
.Pa /etc/passwd ;
the environment comes from
.Pa /etc/profile
.Pq Ev PATH , HOME , TERM , USER , SHELL
plus
.Ev PWD Ns = Ns Pa / .
.Pp
The kernel has no
.Xr exec 2
and a spawned child does not inherit the service's initfs grant, so
.Nm
owns the grant and performs both spawns.
.Nm
exits with the session shell's status; the test service is configured with
.Dq Li "exit_when_exits = getty" .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/etc/profile" -compact
.It Pa /etc/passwd
session shell
.It Pa /etc/profile
session environment
.It Pa /etc/motd
printed by
.Xr login 1
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr login 1 ,
.Xr rsh 1 ,
.Xr consd 8
